				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span>Proinn Consultancy® (branded as PROINN®) is the Indian brand leading knowledge services of imparting &#8220;INVENTIVE THINKING&#8221; &amp; &#8220;PATENT THINKING&#8221; in order to develop differentiated solutions and strong patent portfolios in Indian market. We use TRIZ, DFP® &amp; Accelerating Change with certifications from MATRIZ, DFP-INSTITUE &amp; TRIZTI®. We bring innovation PREDICTABILITY  with inventions in “Physical Devices,&#8221;, &#8220;Manufacturing&#8221;, &#8220;Software/Digital&#8221;,  “Building a culture of Innovation through organizational change initiatives” with tangible results in agreed timelines that clients want.</span></p></div>
